  "releaseNotes": "v0.9.0: customer and product attachments are first-class sub-resources. Customer.Attachment and Product.Attachment download the API's base64-in-JSON FileAttachment response through the normal read resilience pipeline, upload Name and Content, and Product.Attachment can delete or purge an attachment. Downloads keep the global MaxResponseContentBytes bound and add an optional per-call maxBytes limit: oversized declared responses are refused before body reads, chunked responses are bounded while read, decoded bytes are checked before return, and DkPlusAttachmentTooLargeException reports the caller's limit without retaining content. Customer.UploadAttachmentAsync remains compatible and delegates to Customer.Attachment.UploadAsync. Attachment metadata continues to expose Md5Hash and ShowOnWeb; downloaded bytes are deliberately not checked against MD5Hash. Company.Settings adds typed get/query/sparse-update operations for company-scoped GECTRLS, GECTRLN, and GENUMBER records plus a non-atomic string upsert through IDkPlusTableResource.UpsertRecordAsync, selecting no creator or modifier user-name columns. Unlimited table reads now fetch PageSize batches and advance modified from the last RECORDMODIFIED plus one millisecond.",
